# arvo-contracts

The contracts a numeral satisfies, for code generic over one.

Sum, difference, product, order, the two identities, sign, magnitude, construction from a constant and
the monotone sum, each a const trait whose law is stated over the instance's own members. A consumer
that bounds on them depends on this crate alone and names no feature of the toolchain; `arvo-numeral`
implements every one for its value. Depends on `arvo-format`. `no_std`, no allocation.

## Status

Unreleased, at 0.0.0. The surface may still change before a first release.
